<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian rubber market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indonesian rubber market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian rubber market is closed on Wednesday for a Hindu holiday. Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>The benchmark tyre-grade SIR20 was done at 50.00 U.S. cents/lb in Medan on Tuesday for June/July shipment. Offer prices were quoted at 49.75 fob Palembang, at 50.00 fob Surabaya, at 49.50 fob Padang and at 49.25 fob Pontianak and Jambi.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
